cute (SM90/Hopper fast path, tuned dispatch) vs triton (portable fallback)
layernorm_linear(x,g,b,W,bias)  vs  layernorm_linear_triton(...)  — H100 80GB, bf16, forward
square LayerNormLinear (d_in=d_out=d); cute auto-dispatches M2 (N<=256) / M1 (N>256)

